        "reason": "CCME_Values is right-censored at 100.0 (1,012,105 rows = 35.92%). Classification into 5 classes is a secondary view derived from regression predictions. The censoring means standard regression metrics (MSE, MAE) may underestimate error for high-quality sites. Consider Tobit regression or truncated loss in Phase 2.",
